            <note corresp="#d832-f2" n="7" xml:id="d832-f2-content">
                <p>For two notes by the Embassy in Japan to the Japanese Foreign Office on August 6
                    and 7, see <ref target="frus1931-41v01#pg_906">
                        <hi rendition="#italic">Foreign Relations</hi>, Japan, 1931–1941, Vol. <hi
                            rendition="#small-caps">i</hi>, pp. 906</ref> and <ref
                        target="frus1931-41v01#pg_907">907</ref>. For the Japanese reply, see
                    telegram No. 1577, October 7, 10 a.m., from the Ambassador in Japan, <ref
                        target="frus1931-41v01#pg_921">
                        <hi rendition="#italic">ibid.</hi>, p. 921</ref>.</p>
            </note>
        </listAnnotation>
